.We performed extensive design space search of Faster R - CNN configurations on the KITTI dataset .Ourstarting point is the VGG 1 6 network that has achieved high accuracy in both image classification [ 2 1 ] and localization [ 1 9 ] .KITTI images have a native resolution of 1 2 9 5 x 3 7 5 , so the default Faster R - CNN behavior is to resize KITTI images to 1 0 0 0 x 3 0 2 .For example , the conv 5 3 activations -which serves as input to both the region proposal network ( RPN ) and the classification network -double in height and width .In the next section , we consider shallower networks with fewer layers of activation planes , which enables us to move to even higher input resolutions .
