n, employed in this study to evaluate the impact of shallower networks on accuracy. ; A convolutional neural network architecture used for image recognition. ; A convolutional neural network architecture used as a base for R-CNN.\n', 'Name:KITTI\nDescription:A dataset used for car detection tasks. ; A dataset used for object detection, such as identifying cars.\n', 'Name:DEFORMABLE PARTS MODELS (DPM)\nDescription:A method for image object detection, predating deep convolutional neural networks.\n']split_entities: text_tokens=2579, instructions_tokens=500, budget_for_entities=6921, number_of_entities=87, avg_entity_tokens=35, max_entities=197, num_groups=1, entities_per_group=[87]
